{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026S13K7wOn2i1795488203.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>同為《聲夢傳奇》出身的鍾柔美（Yumi）與詹天文（Windy）感情深厚，兩人早前合體大玩創意，拍攝了一組「兔子四格」對比照，以可愛又鬼馬的互動大晒萌爆一面。</p><p><p><img alt=\"yumichung1221_1795430697_4036686494735014386_4859082701.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QpSwnNdoKq1795487999.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"yumichung1221_1795430697_4036686500984598004_4859082701.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KdBMRvfpec1795487993.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"yumichung1221_1795430697_4036686507150323856_4859082701.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GO8EGEGBIL1795487986.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"yumichung1221_1795430697_4036686508047930085_4859082701.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o6cVgsbJBh1795487979.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>在該組上下分格的照片中，一頭啡色長髮的鍾柔美穿上一襲黑色單肩露肩晚裝，配襯閃鑽頸鏈，而束起金色髮髻的詹天文則以白色抹胸禮服亮相，兩人一黑一白在戶外夜色下並肩自拍；照片下半部分則分別配上一隻深啡色兔仔及一隻淺金色兔仔，精準還原兩人的表情與動作，可愛度倍增。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.641743+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T16:57:35.320617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:37:19.137697+00:00","content_hash":"6e7bbb05e6f2d32e35d51eeb617422a13e5e272d0a08b52473867c8bcf157195","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.641743+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}